>have no really good reason to think that they will be.

But we have less reason to suspect they won't.

>  It seems, therefore,
>that uploading is more of a hope, or something believed in on the basis of
>faith, than a proposition based on adequate evidence.

Just as not being afraid of ghosts is faith.  Or belief in negative numbers.

